.temp/TASK-260720-1qhxqa/resources/TASK-260715-1gjxer/TASK-260715-1gjxer_results.md:9:- AC1–AC3: the ADR maps every mandatory M0 gate for both candidates. Every selected libssh2 row is PASS, including macOS integration, pre-auth host policy, approved public-key auth and algorithms, concurrent direct-tcpip, long-lived exec and stdin upload, client and server rekey, bounded buffers and harness memory, deterministic cancellation, privacy-safe diagnostics, Keychain posture, keepalive, lifecycle cleanup, and real relux-server compatibility. No threshold was weakened; any future selected-engine red reopens analysis or the retained alternate.
